      "role": "user",
      "content": "Ok, thanks for the rundown. The segmentation thing is noted. But when you talk about \"minimal known gaps\" in the scanning/monitoring tools specifically—are you saying the tools themselves are 100% reliable for detecting intrusions? I want to be sure there isn't some fundamental flaw in the monitoring layer that would make the audit results inaccurate.",
